WEBVTT

00:04:28.897 --> 00:04:31.497
or be a better anti-racist.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.230
Maybe you want to write a book

00:04:33.263 --> 00:04:35.397
or eat more leafy greens.

00:04:36.063 --> 00:04:38.330
I have great news for you.

00:04:38.763 --> 00:04:42.063
You can do and be those things,

00:04:42.063 --> 00:04:43.997
starting right now.

00:04:44.997 --> 00:04:50.430
The only requirement is that
you stop trying to be so good.

00:04:51.363 --> 00:04:54.430
You'll need to abandon your grand plans,

00:04:54.463 --> 00:04:56.630
at least temporarily.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.830
You'll need to consider
doing something so minuscule